  "power_note": "G253 carries 12 positives against 241 negatives. The corrected analytic minimum detectable AUROC at alpha 0.05 and 80 percent power is 0.7382 (results/accord/audit_c137/a6_delong_mde.json::mde_alt_r4), not the 0.7355 the thesis prints. Outcome B here rules out a large recoverable benefit, not a modest one.",
